<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<title>Kids Story Studio — Film Animé Enfants</title>
<style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    :root {
        --bg: #fff9f0; --panel: #ffffff; --panel-2: #fff4e6; --border: #ffe0b8;
        --ink: #3a2a1a; --ink-dim: #a07a52; --ink-faint: #d4b898;
        --pink: #ff6b9d; --yellow: #ffd93d; --blue: #4ecdc4; --green: #7ed957;
        --orange: #ff9f43; --purple: #b983ff;
        --success: #4caf50; --error: #ff5252; --warn: #ffa726;
        --radius: 16px;
    }
    body {
        font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', 'Chalkboard SE', -apple-system, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9f0 0%, #ffe8f0 50%, #e8f4ff 100%);
        color: var(--ink); min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 1.5rem 1rem 6rem; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5;
        max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    header { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
    h1 {
        font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink), var(--orange), var(--yellow), var(--green), var(--blue), var(--purple));
        -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .subtitle { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-dim); font-style: italic; }

    .toast {
        position: fixed; top: 1.5rem; left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-100px);
        background: var(--ink); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        z-index: 1000; opacity: 0;
        transition: transform 0.35s ease, opacity 0.35s ease;
        max-width: 90vw; text-align: center;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
    }
    .toast.visible { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    .toast.success { background: var(--success); }
    .toast.error { background: var(--error); }
    .toast.warn { background: var(--warn); }
    .toast .toast-icon { font-size: 1rem; }

    .info-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff4e6, #ffe8f0);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--pink);
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem; border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--ink);
        margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .info-banner strong { color: var(--pink); }

    .coppa-badge {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
        background: var(--green); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .free-badge {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
        background: var(--purple); color: #fff;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem; margin-left: 0.4rem;
    }

    .section {
        background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius); margin-bottom: 1rem;
        overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(255,107,157,0.06);
    }
    .section-header {
        padding: 1rem 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; user-select: none;
        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #fff9f0);
    }
    .section-header:active { background: var(--panel-2); }
    .section-title {
        font-size: 0.82rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--pink); font-weight: 700;
    }
    .section-title .badge {
        display: inline-block; margin-left: 0.4rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
        background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0;
    }
    .section-title .badge.soft { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; }
    .section-header .chevron {
        font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-faint); transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .section.open .section-header .chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .section-body { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.35s ease; }
    .section.open .section-body { max-height: 9000px; }
    .section-content { padding: 0 1.2rem 1.2rem; }

    .api-panel {
        background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: border-color 0.3s;
    }
    .api-panel.ok { border-color: var(--green); }

    .api-key-input {
        width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid var(--border);
        background: #fffaf2; color: var(--ink);
        font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
        font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .api-key-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--pink); }

    .api-save-btn {
        width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem;
        border-radius: 10px; border: none;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--orange));
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; font-family: inherit;
        cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .api-save-btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

    .api-status-line {
        font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
        background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-dim);
        transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .api-status-line.ok {
        background: #e8f8e8; color: var(--success); font-weight: 700;
    }
    .api-status-line .status-dot {
        width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--ink-faint); flex-shrink: 0;
        transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .api-status-line.ok .status-dot { background: var(--success); }

    .api-hint { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-top: 0.4rem; }
    .api-hint a { color: var(--pink); text-decoration: underline; }

    .image-gen-status {
        background: #e8f8e8; border: 2px solid var(--green);
        border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
        font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--success); font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .wake-status {
        font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
        border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 0.4rem;
        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
        background: #e8f4ff; color: var(--blue);
        flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .wake-status.active { background: #e8f8e8; color: var(--success); }
    .wake-status.warn { background: #fff4e6; color: var(--warn); }
    .wake-status button {
        background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid currentColor;
        color: inherit; padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.7rem; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;
    }

    .audio-zone {
        border: 3px dashed var(--blue); border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 1.4rem 1rem; text-align: center; cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.2s; margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f4ff, #f0e8ff);
    }
    .audio-zone:active { border-color: var(--purple); }
    .audio-zone.has-file { border-style: solid; border-color: var(--green); background: #e8f8e8; }
    .audio-zone input[type="file"] { display: none; }
    .audio-zone .audio-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .audio-zone .audio-text { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
    .audio-zone .audio-hint { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-top: 0.2rem; }
    .audio-zone .audio-filename {
        font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--success); font-weight: 700;
        margin-top: 0.4rem; word-break: break-all;
    }
    .audio-zone audio {
        width: 100%; margin-top: 0.6rem; border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .audio-remove-btn {
        margin-top: 0.5rem; background: transparent;
        border: 1.5px solid var(--error); color: var(--error);
        padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
    }
    .bpm-display {
        margin-top: 0.6rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 10px; background: #fff;
        border: 2px solid var(--border);
        font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;
        display: none;
    }
    .bpm-display.visible { display: block; }
    .bpm-display.ok { border-color: var(--green); background: #e8f8e8; color: var(--success); }
    .bpm-display.warn { border-color: var(--warn); background: #fff8e8; color: var(--warn); }
    .bpm-display .bpm-value { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; }

    .volume-control {
        margin-top: 0.7rem; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
        background: #fff; border: 2px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
    }
    .volume-control label {
        display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim);
        font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .volume-control input[type="range"] {
        width: 100%; accent-color: var(--pink);
    }
    .volume-control .vol-value {
        font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--pink); font-weight: 700;
        text-align: right; margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }
    .volume-control .duck-toggle {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 0.6rem;
    }
    .volume-control .duck-toggle input {
        width: 18px; height: 18px; accent-color: var(--green);
    }
    .volume-control .duck-toggle label {
        font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: none; margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600;
    }

    .prompt-main {
        width: 100%; padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 10px; border: 2px solid var(--border);
        background: #fffaf2; color: var(--ink);
        font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.9rem;
        min-height: 180px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .prompt-main:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--pink); }
    .prompt-main-hint {
        font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-dim);
        margin-top: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .story-counter {
        font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-dim);
        margin-top: 0.4rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .story-counter strong { color: var(--pink); }

    .prompt-presets {
        display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 0.7rem;
    }
    .prompt-preset {
        padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 20px;
        border: 2px solid var(--border); background: #fff;
        font-size: 0.78rem; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;
        transition: all 0.15s; user-select: none;
    }
    .prompt-preset:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
    .prompt-preset:hover { border-color: var(--pink); background: var(--panel-2); }

    .styles-grid {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(155px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.55rem;
    }
    .style-card {
        padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 12px;
        border: 2px solid var(--border); background: #fff;
        cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem;
    }
    .style-card:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
    .style-card.selected {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--orange));
        color: #fff; border-color: var(--pink);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255,107,157,0.3);
    }
    .style-card .style-emoji { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .style-card .style-name { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
    .style-card .style-desc { font-size: 0.68rem; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 0.1rem; line-height: 1.2; }

    .character-lock {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0e8ff, #e8f4ff);
        border: 2px solid var(--purple);
        border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .character-lock .lock-title {
        font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--purple); font-weight: 700;
        text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .character-lock textarea {
        width: 100%; padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 8px;
        border: 2px solid var(--border); background: #fff;
        font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.82rem;
        min-height: 90px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .character-lock .lock-hint {
        font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim);
        margin-top: 0.4rem; font-style: italic;
    }

    .control-row { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .control-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .control-label {
        display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-dim);
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        font-weight: 700;
    }
    select, input[type="number"], input[type="text"] {
        width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 10px;
        border: 2px solid var(--border); background: #fffaf2;
        color: var(--ink); font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
        -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
    }
    select:focus, input[type="number"]:focus, input[type="text"]:focus {
        outline: none; border-color: var(--pink);
    }
    select {
        background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='10' height='6' viewBox='0 0 10 6'><path fill='%23ff6b9d' d='M0 0l5 6 5-6z'/></svg>");
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-position: right 0.9rem center;
        background-size: 10px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
        width: 100%; padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: none;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--orange), var(--yellow));
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; font-family: inherit;
        cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255,107,157,0.35);
        text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .btn-primary:active:not(:disabled) { transform: scale(0.98); }
    .btn-primary:disabled {
        opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed;
        background: #ccc; box-shadow: none;
    }

    .btn-assemble {
        width: 100%; padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 3px solid var(--green); background: #fff;
        color: var(--green);
        font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; font-family: inherit;
        cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: none;
    }
    .btn-assemble.visible { display: block; }
    .btn-assemble:active { background: #e8f8e8; }

    .btn-download {
        width: 100%; padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: none;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--blue));
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; font-family: inherit;
        cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: none;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(76,175,80,0.3);
    }
    .btn-download.visible { display: block; }
    .btn-download:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

    .btn-stop {
        width: 100%; padding: 0.85rem; border-radius: var(--radius);
        border: 2px solid var(--error); background: #fff;
        color: var(--error); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700;
        font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: none;
    }
    .btn-stop.visible { display: block; }

    .queue { margin-top: 1rem; }
    .queue-summary {
        background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        font-size: 0.8rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem;
    }
    .queue-summary .progress-text { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
    .queue-summary .eta-text { color: var(--ink-dim); }

    .queue-item {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 10px;
        border: 2px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        background: var(--panel); transition: border-color 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .queue-item.pending { opacity: 0.55; }
    .queue-item.creating { border-color: var(--yellow); }
    .queue-item.generating-image { border-color: var(--purple); }
    .queue-item.processing { border-color: var(--blue); }
    .queue-item.done { border-color: var(--green); background: #f0faf0; }
    .queue-item.failed { border-color: var(--error); background: #fff0f0; }
    .queue-item .q-icon { font-size: 1.1rem; width: 1.5rem; text-align: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .queue-item .q-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .queue-item .q-name { font-weight: 700; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .queue-item .q-excerpt { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim); overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; margin-top: 0.1rem; }
    .queue-item .q-status { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim); text-align: right; flex-shrink: 0; max-width: 40%; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .queue-item .q-thumb {
        width: 36px; height: 64px; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden;
        background: #eee; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .queue-item .q-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

    .gallery { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .gallery-grid {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.9rem;
    }
    .gallery-item {
        border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden;
        border: 3px solid var(--border); background: #000;
        animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255,107,157,0.15);
    }
    .gallery-item video { width: 100%; display: block; aspect-ratio: 9/16; object-fit: cover; }
    .gallery-item .g-caption {
        padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem; background: var(--panel);
        font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-dim); font-weight: 600;
    }

    .final-film {
        margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f8e8, #e8f4ff);
        border: 3px solid var(--green); border-radius: var(--radius);
        display: none;
    }
    .final-film.visible { display: block; }
    .final-film h3 {
        font-size: 1rem; color: var(--green); margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }
    .final-film video {
        width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; background: #000;
        aspect-ratio: 9/16; object-fit: cover;
    }

    .progress-bar-container {
        width: 100%; height: 12px; background: var(--panel-2);
        border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin: 0.5rem 0;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .progress-bar-fill {
        height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--pink), var(--orange));
        width: 0%; transition: width 0.3s;
    }

    .status-bar {
        position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink), var(--orange));
        color: #fff; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
        transform: translateY(100%); transition: transform 0.3s;
        z-index: 100; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .status-bar.visible { transform: translateY(0); }
    .status-bar .spinner {
        width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        border-top-color: #fff; border-radius: 50%;
        animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite; flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
    @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

    #noSleepCanvas { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; opacity: 0.01; pointer-events: none; z-index: -1; }
    #noSleepVideo { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; opacity: 0.01; pointer-events: none; z-index: -1; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🌈 Kids Story Studio</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Histoire → Images → Vidéos → Film animé</p>
</header>

<div class="info-banner">
    <div class="coppa-badge">🛡️ COPPA COMPLIANT</div>
    <div class="free-badge">🎉 IMAGES GRATUITES ILLIMITÉES</div>
    <br><br>
    <strong>Accès direct anonyme :</strong> 12 modèles disponibles sans token.
    Attente 20s entre les images pour respecter le rate limit de 15s.
</div>

<div class="api-panel" id="api-panel">
    <label class="control-label" style="margin-bottom:0.4rem;">🔑 Clé API Agnes (vidéos + voix)</label>
    <input type="password" class="api-key-input" id="api-key-input"
           placeholder="Collez votre clé API Agnes (sk-...)" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
    <button type="button" class="api-save-btn" id="api-save-btn">Enregistrer la clé Agnes</button>
    <div class="api-status-line" id="api-status-line">
        <span class="status-dot"></span>
        <span id="api-status-text">Aucune clé API enregistrée</span>
    </div>

    <div class="image-gen-status">
        🎨 <strong>Images : Pollinations.ai</strong> — accès anonyme direct (12 modèles)
        <br>
        🎙️ <strong>Voix : Agnes IA</strong> — voix naturelles et enfantines
    </div>

    <div class="api-hint">
